{
  "name": "VELORA — Events (booking emails)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VELORA events receiver\nReceives signed events from VELORA (`N8N_WEBHOOK_URL`).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Open **Settings** and fill in VELORA_URL, WEBHOOK_SECRET (= N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET) and FROM_EMAIL.\n2. Credentials: **VELORA API** (Header Auth: `Authorization` / `Bearer <N8N_API_KEY>`), **SMTP**.\n3. Self-hosted n8n: set `NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto` (signature check).\n4. Activate, copy the **Production URL** of \"Velora event\" into `N8N_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n\nBad signatures get 401. Duplicate event ids are answered 200 and skipped.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "velora-0117-0000-4000-8000-000000000117",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "velora-events",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "velora-0101-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Velora event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "f18329a3-a3ec-4c7c-bb94-747020945f4a"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "velora-0102-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
              "name": "VELORA_URL",
              "value": "https://velora.example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "velora-0103-0000-4000-8000-000000000103",
              "name": "WEBHOOK_SECRET",
              "value": "paste N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET here",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "velora-0104-0000-4000-8000-000000000104",
              "name": "FROM_EMAIL",
              "value": "VELORA <hello@velora-spa.bg>",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "velora-0105-0000-4000-8000-000000000105",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Checks X-Velora-Signature = hex HMAC-SHA256(body, WEBHOOK_SECRET).\n// VELORA signs JSON.stringify(payload); n8n parses the body, and re-stringifying it gives the same bytes.\n// Self-hosted n8n: allow the crypto module with NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto.\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst secret = $('Settings').first().json.WEBHOOK_SECRET;\nconst req = $('Velora event').first().json;\nconst body = req.body ?? {};\nconst given = String(req.headers['x-velora-signature'] ?? '');\nconst expected = crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(JSON.stringify(body)).digest('hex');\nconst ok = !!secret && given.length === expected.length &&\n  crypto.timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(given), Buffer.from(expected));\n\n// VELORA retries failed sends, so skip event ids that were already handled.\nconst store = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstore.seen = store.seen ?? [];\nconst duplicate = ok && store.seen.includes(body.id);\nif (ok && !duplicate) store.seen = [...store.seen, body.id].slice(-500);\n\nreturn [{ json: { ok, duplicate, ...body } }];"
      },
      "id": "velora-0106-0000-4000-8000-000000000106",
      "name": "Verify signature",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "velora-0107-0000-4000-8000-000000000107",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "velora-0108-0000-4000-8000-000000000108",
      "name": "Signature valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
